  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne bidde ic min arcebiscopas ⁊ ealle mine leodbiscopas, þæt hy ealle neodfulle beon ymbe Godes gerihta, ælc on his ende þe heom betæht is; ⁊ eac minum ealdormannum ic beode, þæt hy fylstan þam biscopum to Godes gerihtum ⁊ to minum kynescype ⁊ to ealles folces þearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Now I pray my archbishops and all my diocesan bishops to be zealous with regard to the rights of the church—each one in the district which is entrusted to him; and likewise I enjoin upon my ealdormen to support the bishops in furthering the rights of the church and my royal authority and the well-being of the whole nation.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
